            <ArticleTitle>CT studies in patients operated with stereotaxic thalamotomies.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>561-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>CT has been used in controlling stereotaxic thalamotomies in patients with movement disorders. The results obtained in 12 such patients, with early and delayed scans, are presented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
